  "plain": "In 1948, at Hart Canyon near Aztec, New Mexico, where a saucer is said to have come down, a preacher named Solon Brown later said he saw a few beings inside the craft, maybe three, slumped over some kind of table or panel. Michels tells this himself, repeating what Brown said years afterward. If true, it would be an eyewitness account of the crew of a crashed craft."
